{"path":".agents/skills/comprehende/references/example.md","ref":"ef1e688be084667a7f76ce365dfbe44bba1f7f55","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":1,"text":"# Example review.json"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"d6a529bc7809dc9302df686259e8bb39003cd422","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790116873,"line":3,"text":"Optional filled sample. The field shape in `SKILL.md` is enough to write a document. Paths come from `comprehende review`. When a file is split, `oldStart` and `newStart` come from that hunk's `@@` header."},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"ee9f79a7d6790f4e36ca9f027a1c799c3b386ced","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790349567,"line":5,"text":"- `login` depends on `cookie`. Both use `part` \"Session cookie\". The helper's test sits in `cookie` with the helper it checks."},{"sha":"123b37bed0b9c4dafff5b5a187a0f73192913854","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787409379,"line":6,"text":"- `docs` is a separate part, last in `suggestedOrder`, because it could have been its own pull request."},{"sha":"c77e82775e65bb5e490a77688e8ffd272829c18f","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789847074,"line":7,"text":"- Ticket #12 names why this work exists, so document `why` is present. Document `title` keeps the ticket title. Document `summary` names both stories. Document `parts` holds a one-sentence what per story. The why cites the ticket with `[#12](source:s1)`."},{"sha":"123b37bed0b9c4dafff5b5a187a0f73192913854","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787409379,"line":8,"text":"- `login` `summary` names how those hunks meet. `login` `lookFor` is a predicted trace. `docs` has no `lookFor`."},{"sha":"db481f3c643558b8140ada24dbd8c0978b611d30","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789216668,"line":9,"text":"- Document `lookFor` compares ticket #12 with the diff: work the ticket asks for that no hunk does, and one claim about the whole change. Both cite `[#12](source:s1)`. Group `lookFor` stays inside its hunks."},{"sha":"ee9f79a7d6790f4e36ca9f027a1c799c3b386ced","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790349567,"line":10,"text":"- Each group holds every hunk of its files, so each `hunkRefs` entry is a path. A split file uses `path@oldStart+newStart` (`old/path -> new/path@oldStart+newStart` when renamed)."},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":12,"text":"```json"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":13,"text":"{"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":14,"text":"  \"version\": 1,"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":15,"text":"  \"source\": {"},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":16,"text":"    \"baseRef\": \"origin/main\","},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":17,"text":"    \"headRef\": \"HEAD\","},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":18,"text":"    \"range\": \"origin/main...HEAD\""},{"sha":"49eaa02828541874edbb79ee96464387fceef7ad","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786681607,"line":19,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"5c713233ac7998a896201cef62027b5b4e3a2bd7","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786706250,"line":20,"text":"  \"size\": \"small\","},{"sha":"ff0f5fae42df12fc5d0b073309336d2d26099a58","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787947290,"line":21,"text":"  \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{